Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.98,0:00:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}归途之上  雏鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.65,0:00:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}像是要逃离一般
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.32,0:00:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}从电线上的枯草巢中跌落
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.70,0:00:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}你却视而不见
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.75,0:00:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}归途，徒有其名
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.41,0:00:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}没有去处
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.17,0:00:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}公园消逝于虚空的暮色之歌
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.47,0:00:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}将你引向孤独
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.47,0:00:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}无论多么绚丽的色彩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.27,0:00:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}你都不愿相信
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.48,0:01:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}可你一直被珍视着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.52,0:01:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}请一定记在心里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.91,0:01:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}心灵的归宿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.78,0:01:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}你哭着说失去了它
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.41,0:01:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}将别人伸出的手掌
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.08,0:01:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}不明所以地踩碎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.71,0:01:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}那时大概别无选择
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.81,0:01:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}想消失  悄悄地
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.47,0:01:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}那不是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.17,0:01:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}独自在公园数花
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.48,0:01:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}却不够扎成一束
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.57,0:01:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}对谁都温柔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.28,0:01:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}那样会很累吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.61,0:01:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}因为没有什么不会减少
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.58,0:02:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}因为一切有限
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.89,0:02:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}憎恨自己的出身
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.88,0:02:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}无法停止而入睡的你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.51,0:02:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}在好不容易浮起的梦中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.03,0:02:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}愿你幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.85,0:02:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}一定很快又能笑出来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.44,0:02:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}啊，越是长大
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.19,0:02:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}越看不清的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.48,0:02:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}然而
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}仍就在身旁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.86,0:02:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}流泪这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.84,0:02:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}被踩踏的手的疼痛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.42,0:02:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}以及用温柔做成的花束
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.05,0:02:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}因为你亲眼见过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.56,0:03:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}心灵的归宿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.48,0:03:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}只要想起，它一直都在
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.11,0:03:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}来吧 去看明天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.73,0:03:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}虽然也会迷茫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.17,0:03:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}但一定很快又能笑出来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.27,0:03:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\an8}悲盲\N作词/作曲/视频制作：Namimoyō
